  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> strong War; <strong>CL</strong> 12th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 98,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 8 lbs.</p>\n<p>The warmage’s staff is a long, heavy metal pole suitable for use as a club. When held, it functions as a +4 aggressive watchful War implement. Some wealthy generals enchant these staves with a rally talent they want to use.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Implement Of Power, War sphere; <strong>Cost</strong> 49,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/implements#toc34\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
